to go as high as 30 grand.


00:54:49.788 --> 00:54:51.257
All right.


00:54:51.289 --> 00:54:55.760
Do you think you can
stay in there a little longer?


00:55:02.867 --> 00:55:05.938
The husband works in
an abandoned coal mine.


00:55:05.972 --> 00:55:07.304
This is his headquarters.


00:55:07.306 --> 00:55:08.972
This is an overview of
the entire compound.


00:55:08.974 --> 00:55:10.276
It's filled with many warehouses


00:55:10.309 --> 00:55:12.976
we believe can hold up to
5,000 pounds of marijuana.


00:55:15.146 --> 00:55:17.650
I will
faithfully execute the office


00:55:17.715 --> 00:55:19.818
of President of
the United States.


00:55:19.885 --> 00:55:22.054
And will,
to the best of my abilities.


00:55:22.086 --> 00:55:24.255
And will,
to the best of my abilities.


00:55:24.289 --> 00:55:25.491
Preserve, protect,


00:55:25.556 --> 00:55:27.092
and defend the Constitution.


00:56:01.360 --> 00:56:04.364
I told you you
can't come here.


00:56:06.030 --> 00:56:07.363
