00:56:09.201 --> 00:56:12.038
I waited at the
motel for an hour.


00:56:13.472 --> 00:56:15.041
I told you sometimes
things would come up


00:56:15.108 --> 00:56:16.876
and I wouldn't be
able to see you.


00:56:16.943 --> 00:56:18.541
Okay?
I told you that.


00:56:18.543 --> 00:56:20.545
Why didn't you call?


00:56:20.612 --> 00:56:22.981
'Cause something came up.


00:56:23.648 --> 00:56:25.150
Why didn't you answer...


00:56:25.184 --> 00:56:27.987
'Cause something
came up, Susan.


00:56:29.121 --> 00:56:32.889
Susan, I can't always drop
everything for you, okay?


00:56:32.891 --> 00:56:34.025
I have a job.


00:56:35.795 --> 00:56:36.996
Have a family.


00:56:37.028 --> 00:56:38.898
But I need you, too.


00:56:44.369 --> 00:56:46.072
When me and Cash...


00:56:47.371 --> 00:56:51.242
were in Pittsburgh,
we knew a drug dealer


00:56:51.309 --> 00:56:54.713
who had a cop in his
pocket, a captain.


00:57:03.387 --> 00:57:05.657
Now, you gotta look
into that, don't you?


00:57:06.858 --> 00:57:09.762
It'd be a feather in
your cap, wouldn't it?


00:57:09.829 --> 00:57:13.932
To bust a crooked captain
on the Pittsburgh PD.


00:57:16.369 --> 00:57:17.670
When was this?


00:57:17.702 --> 00:57:21.606
Before I got pregnant
by Cash like a fool.


00:57:24.443 --> 00:57:26.278
All right, listen.


00:57:26.344 --> 00:57:28.346
We'll talk about
it sometime, okay?


00:57:28.380 --> 00:57:29.582
When?


00:57:30.182 --> 00:57:31.617
