00:58:05.985 --> 00:58:06.751
Bullshit.


00:58:07.753 --> 00:58:10.255
Bumpy said he saw you
comin' outta there.


00:58:10.289 --> 00:58:11.590
I didn't say I wasn't there.


00:58:11.623 --> 00:58:14.492
