get him high, right?


00:58:18.664 --> 00:58:20.162
What are you...


00:58:20.164 --> 00:58:21.933
Why don't you go stay
at your boyfriend's house,


00:58:21.967 --> 00:58:23.068
whoever he is?


00:58:24.003 --> 00:58:24.937
You c...


00:58:25.469 --> 00:58:26.738
You can't do this.


00:58:26.771 --> 00:58:30.141
If you come in here, I'll
break your fuckin' neck.


00:58:30.175 --> 00:58:30.976
No.


00:58:31.010 --> 00:58:32.245
No, Cash.


00:58:32.277 --> 00:58:33.512
Cash, you can't!


00:58:34.346 --> 00:58:37.650
You get
the hell outta here!


00:58:48.693 --> 00:58:51.030
