00:58:51.096 --> 00:58:52.831
At least for tonight.


00:58:52.864 --> 00:58:56.635
Tomorrow, she can move
in with her sister.


00:58:58.469 --> 00:58:59.538
We have to.


00:58:59.605 --> 00:59:01.206
She can't go home.


00:59:02.273 --> 00:59:03.875
I don't believe that.


00:59:03.942 --> 00:59:06.344
You think that
she's making it up?


00:59:06.378 --> 00:59:08.146
I wouldn't
put it past her.


00:59:08.179 --> 00:59:10.347
She's not a liar.


00:59:10.382 --> 00:59:12.217
How do you know?


00:59:12.284 --> 00:59:14.152
'Cause I know that you
would never take the word


00:59:14.186 --> 00:59:18.190
