you knew to be a liar.


00:59:18.224 --> 00:59:21.391
Long-fought battle
to become a serious artist.


00:59:21.393 --> 00:59:23.295
Then she steeped
into the spotlight,


00:59:23.327 --> 00:59:26.063
and she is quite remarkable.


00:59:26.130 --> 00:59:28.966
Still quick to protect
her private life,


00:59:29.001 --> 00:59:32.471
