reel him back in.


01:01:30.688 --> 01:01:33.356
Then I found out what
was really goin' on.


01:01:33.358 --> 01:01:35.126
Can I tell you my news now?


01:01:35.159 --> 01:01:36.127
Sure.


01:01:36.161 --> 01:01:37.762
Sure, what's that?


01:01:40.132 --> 01:01:41.367
I'm pregnant.


01:01:50.208 --> 01:01:51.210
Due in March.


01:01:52.710 --> 01:01:54.446
Which wasn't part
of the plan, but...


01:01:55.179 --> 01:01:56.715
it's great anyway.


01:01:57.715 --> 01:01:59.217
Don't you think?


01:02:02.454 --> 01:02:04.023
It's incredible.


01:02:07.726 --> 01:02:08.727
I'd
been fornicatin'


01:02:08.793 --> 01:02:10.728
like a long-eared rabbit,


01:02:10.795 --> 01:02:13.229
and Kathy gets pregnant?


01:02:13.231 --> 01:02:14.063
Shit.


01:02:56.342 --> 01:02:57.409
Hey, Susie.


01:03:04.282 --> 01:03:06.351
How y'all doin'?


01:03:06.385 --> 01:03:07.386
How's Cash?


01:03:10.121 --> 01:03:14.058
Yeah, everything's
okay, thanks, Rufus.


01:03:14.092 --> 01:03:17.027
Well, I hope
business is good, too.


01:03:17.061 --> 01:03:19.798
It's almost end of the month.


01:03:30.141 --> 01:03:31.710
Now, what's got you so upset


01:03:31.742 --> 01:03:36.315
you had to come all the way
here and tell me about it?


01:03:37.949 --> 01:03:42.320
The FBI is about to bust
your pot smuggling deal.


01:03:48.159 --> 01:03:50.094
And how the fuck
would you know?


01:03:50.128 --> 01:03:52.431
Trust me, Rufus, I know.


01:05:27.891 --> 01:05:29.260
We're up on the hill
watchin' the place,


01:05:29.327 --> 01:05:32.563
