came down goin' real fast.


01:05:32.597 --> 01:05:35.934
Couldn't get down here
near in time to catch 'em.


01:05:36.001 --> 01:05:37.336
Yeah, I heard.


01:05:38.170 --> 01:05:40.739
We won't all his
connections, but


01:05:40.771 --> 01:05:42.039
