loose pot around here


01:05:42.074 --> 01:05:43.842
to make an interstate
trafficking case


01:05:43.876 --> 01:05:46.178
against old Rufus Greene.


01:05:50.581 --> 01:05:51.884
Sorry, Mark.


01:05:51.916 --> 01:05:54.252
No, it's not your fault.


01:05:56.954 --> 01:05:59.257
The hell y'all doin' here?


01:05:59.289 --> 01:06:02.027
