now, Rufus?


01:06:07.132 --> 01:06:09.268
Or do you want to wait
til you're indicted?


01:06:09.300 --> 01:06:11.436
Now, that'll be the day.


01:06:11.469 --> 01:06:14.806
Now, I ain't been up
this way in years.


01:06:14.873 --> 01:06:17.208
Now, I got plans
for this property,


01:06:17.242 --> 01:06:19.444
but I don't hang around here.


01:06:19.476 --> 01:06:21.211
This is a dump.


01:06:21.246 --> 01:06:24.249
I can back him up
on that, officer.


01:06:24.282 --> 01:06:26.117
I ain't never been up
here before, neither.


01:06:26.150 --> 01:06:28.152
We got photos of
him here, dumb ass.


01:06:28.219 --> 01:06:29.387
Fuck you callin' dumb?


01:06:29.420 --> 01:06:33.324
And it's Special Agent
Putnam to you, boy.


01:06:34.791 --> 01:06:35.927
Well, then you got pictures


01:06:35.960 --> 01:06:39.764
