01:06:39.797 --> 01:06:41.099
That's right.


01:06:43.601 --> 01:06:44.769
What'd you just say?


01:06:44.802 --> 01:06:46.605
You heard me.


01:06:46.637 --> 01:06:48.507
What'd you just say?


01:06:51.742 --> 01:06:53.612
