01:07:51.202 --> 01:07:52.737
Mommy.


01:07:54.905 --> 01:07:56.074
Mommy.


01:07:56.141 --> 01:08:00.412
Shh, it's
okay, it's okay, sweetie.


01:08:29.907 --> 01:08:30.708
Mommy!


01:08:30.742 --> 01:08:31.743
