house last night.


01:09:50.822 --> 01:09:52.990
You don't blame me, do you?


01:09:53.024 --> 01:09:54.293
Yeah, I do.


01:09:56.461 --> 01:09:58.697
Well, I did not
tell Rufus Greene


01:09:58.764 --> 01:10:01.800
- about your precious drug bust.
- Of course you did, Susan.


01:10:01.832 --> 01:10:02.833
Bullshit.


01:10:03.701 --> 01:10:05.302
Jesus Christ, stop lying.


01:10:05.337 --> 01:10:06.838
My kid was in that house!


01:10:06.871 --> 01:10:08.204
You put my family in danger!


01:10:08.206 --> 01:10:09.373
I did not.


01:10:11.876 --> 01:10:14.311
I got six grand in
this bag here for you.


01:10:14.345 --> 01:10:18.883
You sign this receipt, I'll
give it to you right now.


01:10:21.552 --> 01:10:24.521
I was gonna hold onto it
til after you testified.


01:10:24.555 --> 01:10:29.394
Then I realised I needed to
get through this encounter.


01:10:30.862 --> 01:10:33.530
This encounter's gonna
be hard for you, huh?


01:10:33.564 --> 01:10:35.567
No, it's gonna
be hard for you.


01:10:35.634 --> 01:10:37.400
I don't want to see you anymore.


01:10:37.402 --> 01:10:38.802
Do you understand?


01:10:38.836 --> 01:10:39.804
