"only if you have to"?


01:10:42.541 --> 01:10:44.141
If there's blood on
the ground, call me.


01:10:44.175 --> 01:10:45.577
Otherwise, leave me alone.


01:10:45.643 --> 01:10:46.909
Well, it don't
work that way, Mark.


01:10:46.911 --> 01:10:48.579
It do not work that way!


01:10:48.645 --> 01:10:53.317
This ain't a way to treat
your star-fuckin'-witness!


01:11:48.140 --> 01:11:49.441
Hey, Mom,
it's a Mustang!


01:11:49.474 --> 01:11:51.242
How do you
know what a Mustang is?


01:11:51.275 --> 01:11:52.277
Everyone knows.


01:11:52.310 --> 01:11:53.612
Everyone
knows, do they?


01:11:53.645 --> 01:11:55.947
And my girl knows as well.


01:11:55.980 --> 01:11:57.282
And what do you think, mister?


01:11:57.314 --> 01:11:58.281
Where the hell
you steal that at?


01:11:58.315 --> 01:11:59.917
I love it!


01:12:00.819 --> 01:12:02.220
I bought it.


01:12:02.252 --> 01:12:04.154
With what?


01:12:04.221 --> 01:12:06.389
With half the
four grand I got.


01:12:06.423 --> 01:12:07.591
I'm a give you the other half.


01:12:07.625 --> 01:12:09.493
Where the hell
you get four grand?


01:12:09.560 --> 01:12:14.499
I extorted that guy, that
guy from the Red Clay Motel.


01:12:23.809 --> 01:12:24.775
All right.


01:12:24.809 --> 01:12:25.811
Gimme the money.


01:12:25.844 --> 01:12:27.175
Are we even?


01:12:27.177 --> 01:12:28.912
What do you mean?


01:12:28.947 --> 01:12:30.845
You know what I mean.


01:12:30.847 --> 01:12:31.850
Are we even?


01:12:38.122 --> 01:12:39.957
Yeah.
Gimme the money.


