to go and spill some.


01:14:10.015 --> 01:14:11.015
I tell you what.


01:14:11.048 --> 01:14:13.417
If I'd known you to come,


01:14:13.451 --> 01:14:17.122
I woulda kicked his
ass a whole lot sooner.


01:14:20.524 --> 01:14:21.725
You hear me?


01:14:26.764 --> 01:14:29.034
It's from Kathy.


01:14:34.439 --> 01:14:36.074
Oh, God, Mark.


01:14:36.740 --> 01:14:37.875
You are the...


01:14:37.908 --> 01:14:41.779
