who's been good to me.


01:14:43.146 --> 01:14:45.082
Lock the door, will ya?


01:14:46.885 --> 01:14:50.454
I'm trying to stop
betraying my wife.


01:14:50.488 --> 01:14:54.793
And she thinks if I avoid
you, I'm betraying you.


01:14:57.494 --> 01:15:00.931
