lettin' everybody down.


01:15:03.768 --> 01:15:04.335
Susan?


01:15:04.969 --> 01:15:08.838
Look, you gotta stay away
from Cash until the trial.


01:15:09.105 --> 01:15:09.907
I want you in good shape


01:15:09.940 --> 01:15:11.007
if you're gonna
testify against...


01:15:11.074 --> 01:15:12.777
