01:15:20.451 --> 01:15:21.853
More than ever.


01:15:30.994 --> 01:15:34.265
If you go, I don't
know what I'll do.


01:16:08.064 --> 01:16:08.731
Okay?


01:16:09.667 --> 01:16:10.635
Look, you're gonna be fine.


01:16:10.667 --> 01:16:12.402
All you gotta do
is tell the truth.


01:16:12.470 --> 01:16:13.672
All right?


01:16:15.972 --> 01:16:16.975
Okay.


01:16:22.646 --> 01:16:26.082
You ready to
meet your new partner?


01:16:26.149 --> 01:16:27.384
My what?


01:16:27.417 --> 01:16:29.319
Your new partner.


01:16:29.353 --> 01:16:32.556
Bob Singer, this
is Mark Putnam.


01:16:32.590 --> 01:16:35.257
I don't like carrying rookies.


01:16:35.259 --> 01:16:36.493
You shouldn't have to, Bob.


01:16:36.527 --> 01:16:40.698
Obviously you're
carrying enough as it is.


01:16:40.730 --> 01:16:43.199
Bob worked undercover
drugs in Baltimore.


01:16:43.234 --> 01:16:44.599
Tough duty.


01:16:44.601 --> 01:16:45.668
Somebody tried to kill him,


01:16:45.703 --> 01:16:47.771
so the bureau
transferred him here.


01:16:47.837 --> 01:16:49.572
Someone who'd make
your little bank robber


01:16:49.606 --> 01:16:51.743
look like a schoolgirl.


01:16:52.943 --> 01:16:54.244
If somebody tries to kill you,


01:16:54.279 --> 01:16:55.413
