01:16:55.447 --> 01:16:56.777
Of course.


01:16:56.779 --> 01:16:58.949
Think of the liability.


01:17:33.417 --> 01:17:34.419
Snitch!


01:17:50.667 --> 01:17:52.836
Raise your right hand.


01:17:59.944 --> 01:18:02.313
Do you solemnly swear to tell
the truth, the whole truth,


01:18:02.345 --> 01:18:06.182
and nothin' but the
truth, so help you God?


01:18:06.250 --> 01:18:07.484
Yeah, I do.


01:18:07.518 --> 01:18:09.186
Please be seated.


01:18:10.988 --> 01:18:14.258
How long
have you known Mr. Reevis?


01:18:14.291 --> 01:18:18.362
Since he got outta prison
and come stay with us.


01:18:18.429 --> 01:18:21.199
Last year in the
spring, I guess.


01:18:22.533 --> 01:18:24.200
The fall.


01:18:24.202 --> 01:18:25.603
I'm sorry, I...


01:18:25.636 --> 01:18:27.204
I didn't mean that.
I was confused.


01:18:27.271 --> 01:18:28.872
It's been a while.


01:18:30.041 --> 01:18:31.275
In the fall.


01:18:31.307 --> 01:18:32.609
All right.


01:18:32.644 --> 01:18:34.779
Could you tell us,
in your own words,


01:18:34.811 --> 01:18:37.181
what you found in his room?


01:18:38.882 --> 01:18:40.216
He had a green
duffel bag with two


01:18:40.283 --> 01:18:44.385
sawed off shotguns in it
and two black ski masks.


01:18:44.387 --> 01:18:45.523
- Liar!
- You are a liar!


01:18:47.158 --> 01:18:48.723
Thank
you very much, Miss Smith.


01:18:48.725 --> 01:18:50.862
Thank you for your courage.


01:18:50.895 --> 01:18:54.031
You've begun to make it safe
for a person in Pike County


01:18:54.064 --> 01:18:57.335
to go into the bank and
deposit their paycheck


01:18:57.368 --> 01:18:58.336
without being...


01:18:58.368 --> 01:18:59.067
When
a man tells you


01:18:59.069 --> 01:19:02.039
you're doin' the right thing...


01:19:04.074 --> 01:19:08.145
he means you're doin'
the right thing for him.


01:19:22.091 --> 01:19:24.862
Water heater's busted again.


01:19:29.399 --> 01:19:32.768
What, it's gonna take two of
y'all to fix the water heater?


01:19:32.770 --> 01:19:34.769
Apparently the FBI have
rules about male agents


01:19:34.771 --> 01:19:36.841
being left alone with
female informants.


01:19:36.873 --> 01:19:38.509
That's funny.


01:19:38.542 --> 01:19:39.944
Nobody told me.


01:19:41.744 --> 01:19:43.881
Yeah, nobody told me either.


01:19:43.913 --> 01:19:47.117
They damn well
should have.


01:19:47.184 --> 01:19:49.052
I knew Mark didn't
have no use for me no more.


01:19:50.354 --> 01:19:52.120
He'd already told me he
was turning his drug case


01:19:52.122 --> 01:19:53.457
over to fat Bob.


01:19:57.795 --> 01:19:59.564
But when I heard he
was leaving town,


01:19:59.596 --> 01:20:04.301
and he didn't have the guts
to tell me to my face...


01:20:06.103 --> 01:20:08.806
That I had to see for myself.


01:20:12.743 --> 01:20:13.644
I've been fuckin'
your husband!


01:20:13.711 --> 01:20:15.445
You know that?


01:20:15.479 --> 01:20:16.779
I said...


01:20:16.814 --> 01:20:21.485
I've been fuckin' your fuckin'
husband, you stupid cow!


01:20:23.252 --> 01:20:23.953
Oh, what?


01:20:23.988 --> 01:20:26.155
Don't that mean nothin' to you?


01:20:26.157 --> 01:20:29.159
Don't that make
you feel nothin'?


01:20:29.827 --> 01:20:31.996
It makes me feel bad.


01:20:32.662 --> 01:20:34.097
For you.


01:20:34.131 --> 01:20:35.798
That you wanted a
better life so much


01:20:35.832 --> 01:20:39.803
that you thought you
could just take mine.


01:20:39.837 --> 01:20:41.673
It's not gonna happen.


01:20:50.146 --> 01:20:51.149
Shit.


01:20:56.319 --> 01:21:00.157
I guess everybody
got what they wanted.


01:21:00.190 --> 01:21:03.661
Mark was the golden
boy of the FBI.


01:21:03.694 --> 01:21:05.930
This is Mark
Putnam, everybody.


01:21:05.962 --> 01:21:07.528
He's broken more cases
in his first year


01:21:07.530 --> 01:21:09.132
than any two of you together.


01:21:09.166 --> 01:21:10.934
If you want to learn
how to be meticulous


01:21:10.967 --> 01:21:13.604
and thorough, watch this guy.


01:21:17.041 --> 01:21:18.175
Kathy
got the big house


01:21:18.207 --> 01:21:20.644
and, of course, Mr. Perfect.


01:21:20.677 --> 01:21:21.945
Sold!


01:21:23.014 --> 01:21:26.048
Rufus Greene
retired to Mexico.


01:21:26.050 --> 01:21:29.453
Denver Rhodes got 30
grand and blew it.


01:21:29.487 --> 01:21:34.190
Fat Bob got to run the
Pikeville FBI all by himself.


01:21:34.225 --> 01:21:38.061
Even my dumb ass brother
Bones got off for time served.


01:21:38.127 --> 01:21:40.562
Me?
Well, guess what I got.


01:21:40.564 --> 01:21:41.531
Traitor!


01:21:43.967 --> 01:21:45.670
Come on, get up, Susie!


01:21:46.804 --> 01:21:48.736
Get over here, bitch!


01:22:00.717 --> 01:22:01.985
Come on, Georgia!


01:22:02.019 --> 01:22:03.922
You stupid mother!


01:22:06.390 --> 01:22:10.360
You'd sell your
fuckin' husband, bitch!


01:22:10.394 --> 01:22:11.829
Help me.


01:22:11.862 --> 01:22:15.599
Why think you can come around
here anymore, I don't know!


01:22:26.176 --> 01:22:27.177
Bitch.


01:22:34.452 --> 01:22:37.285
The day Mark
Putnam came to town


01:22:37.287 --> 01:22:39.958
is the day my life went to shit.


01:22:40.890 --> 01:22:44.228
You wanna do somethin'
about it, Susie?


01:22:44.627 --> 01:22:45.630
Like what?


01:22:46.930 --> 01:22:48.464
And don't call me Susie.


01:22:48.466 --> 01:22:51.069
Like file an
official complaint.


01:22:52.069 --> 01:22:53.204
The bureau'd take
your allegations


01:22:53.237 --> 01:22:55.806
very, very seriously.


01:22:55.872 --> 01:22:57.406
I look to you like
the kinda person


01:22:57.440 --> 01:23:01.143
gets revenge by
filing a complaint?


01:23:01.145 --> 01:23:03.781
Well, what do you want to do?


01:23:03.814 --> 01:23:05.816
I'll help you do it.


01:23:05.882 --> 01:23:09.052
Whatever it is,
I'll help you do it.


01:23:13.923 --> 01:23:16.393
Want me to take you to the ER?


01:23:16.426 --> 01:23:17.428
No.


01:23:29.439 --> 01:23:30.475
I can
send you the report,


01:23:30.507 --> 01:23:32.475
but it's gonna be
heavily redacted.


01:23:36.012 --> 01:23:37.346
I can't tell you who they are.


01:23:37.413 --> 01:23:39.148
I can compromise
their operation.


01:23:39.181 --> 01:23:41.184
Illinois, 9011, yes.


01:23:42.520 --> 01:23:46.424
Arrester Mr. Abbons
Huggins, address 141203


01:23:47.256 --> 01:23:48.625
- Lakeshore Drive.
- Hey, Mark.


01:23:48.658 --> 01:23:50.092
You know someone named Susan?


01:23:50.127 --> 01:23:52.363
Who may be a tad hostile?


01:23:54.530 --> 01:23:58.536
Yeah, I'll take her
in the conference room.


01:24:07.711 --> 01:24:08.713
Hello?


01:24:09.979 --> 01:24:11.614
Hello...


01:24:11.649 --> 01:24:12.650
Mr. Perfect.


01:24:14.685 --> 01:24:16.954
You know, you should've
been an agent, Susan.


01:24:16.988 --> 01:24:18.055
How'd you find me?


01:24:18.122 --> 01:24:19.824
Cut the crap, Mark!


01:24:19.856 --> 01:24:20.824
I'm pregnant.


01:24:20.858 --> 01:24:22.723
What are you...


01:24:22.725 --> 01:24:24.161
Jesus Christ.


01:24:25.561 --> 01:24:26.163
Susan...


01:24:27.131 --> 01:24:29.734
You wanna
know what he said?


01:24:29.800 --> 01:24:30.833
Are you sure?


01:24:30.868 --> 01:24:31.802
He asked
me if I was sure


01:24:31.835 --> 01:24:33.302
it was his, son of a bitch.


01:24:33.337 --> 01:24:34.371
I'm not saying it like that.


01:24:34.404 --> 01:24:36.139
I'm saying, are
you sure it's mine?


01:24:36.172 --> 01:24:37.707
You find
out what a man's made of


01:24:37.740 --> 01:24:38.742
when you catch him by surprise.


01:24:38.809 --> 01:24:40.043
Look...


01:24:40.077 --> 01:24:41.744
I'm coming back to court
in Pikeville in two weeks.


01:24:41.811 --> 01:24:43.247
We'll talk then.


01:24:43.881 --> 01:24:45.083
Okay?


01:25:32.596 --> 01:25:35.931
What the fuck
took you so long?


01:25:35.966 --> 01:25:36.700
What?


01:25:36.733 --> 01:25:37.734
I saw you park!


01:25:37.768 --> 01:25:41.803
What the fuck took you
so long to get up here?


01:25:41.805 --> 01:25:42.874
What are you talkin' about?


01:25:42.907 --> 01:25:44.608
Oh, I am sick of
this shit, Mark!


01:25:44.640 --> 01:25:48.145
You fucked me over,
you piece of shit!


01:25:49.913 --> 01:25:51.215
How'd you even
know I was here?


01:25:51.247 --> 01:25:53.951
'Cause I'm staying here?


01:25:53.984 --> 01:25:55.753
In the Pikeville?


01:25:55.786 --> 01:25:56.886
Who's payin' for that?


01:25:56.920 --> 01:25:57.922
The FBI.


01:25:58.988 --> 01:26:00.056
Oh, you mean Bob Singer.


01:26:00.090 --> 01:26:01.123
Yeah.


01:26:01.158 --> 01:26:02.059
And why is Bob
Singer paying for you


01:26:02.091 --> 01:26:03.259
to stay the Pikeville?


01:26:03.292 --> 01:26:06.429
Oh, so I can chew your
head off, that's why.


01:26:06.463 --> 01:26:10.100
'Cause he hates the
fact that I fucked you


01:26:10.134 --> 01:26:12.435
and I will not fuck his fat ass!


01:26:12.469 --> 01:26:13.471
Shh!


01:26:13.503 --> 01:26:15.506
I told you I'd make
time this weekend.


01:26:15.573 --> 01:26:17.274
I'm ready now.


01:26:17.306 --> 01:26:18.608
Well I'm not, Susan.


01:26:18.643 --> 01:26:20.577
I'm beat, and I gotta prep
this drug trafficking case


01:26:20.609 --> 01:26:22.145
all day at the
courthouse tomorrow.


01:26:22.179 --> 01:26:26.016
You know, I shoulda killed
her when I had the chance.


01:26:26.082 --> 01:26:27.817
Killed who, Susan?


01:26:30.186 --> 01:26:32.189
I didn't mean that.


01:26:33.323 --> 01:26:34.858
Just slipped out.


01:26:35.826 --> 01:26:37.194
I mean, Jesus, look at you.


01:26:37.261 --> 01:26:39.763
You're so stoned, you don't
even know what you're saying.


01:26:39.796 --> 01:26:41.832
Fuck you, Mark.


01:26:42.934 --> 01:26:44.701
When was the
last time you ate?


01:26:44.768 --> 01:26:45.435
Huh?


01:26:45.469 --> 01:26:48.370
Have you eaten anything all day?


01:26:48.372 --> 01:26:50.106
Let me drop my bags,
and I'll take you


01:26:50.140 --> 01:26:52.343
to the drive-thru, okay?


01:26:53.042 --> 01:26:54.211
Okay?


01:26:55.045 --> 01:26:56.279
Okay.


01:27:11.828 --> 01:27:13.396
I ain't got no money.


01:27:13.462 --> 01:27:15.729
Everyone in this
town wants me dead.


01:27:15.731 --> 01:27:16.699
Jesus.


01:27:16.734 --> 01:27:19.901
So what happened to
witness protection?


01:27:19.903 --> 01:27:22.737
They gave me the cash
to relocate on my own.


01:27:22.739 --> 01:27:24.407
Okay, so
what happened to that?


01:27:24.474 --> 01:27:25.907
What happened to it?


01:27:25.909 --> 01:27:27.077
I'm an addict.


01:27:27.144 --> 01:27:29.981
What do you think
happened to it?


01:27:31.180 --> 01:27:34.250
You left me barefoot
and pregnant, Mark.


01:27:34.318 --> 01:27:35.886
What do you want
me to do, Susan?


01:27:35.920 --> 01:27:38.055
I want you to suffer.


01:27:38.087 --> 01:27:40.157
I mean about the baby.


01:27:40.190 --> 01:27:42.924
I'm a tell your
wife about the baby.


01:27:42.926 --> 01:27:44.695
I'm gonna tell the FBI.


01:27:44.728 --> 01:27:47.898
Fat Bob says they will
fire you on the spot!


01:27:47.930 --> 01:27:49.599
Fat Bob again, huh?


01:27:49.667 --> 01:27:52.336
You're everything that
he hates about the bureau.


01:27:52.368 --> 01:27:56.239
Bunch of candy-ass hypocrites
wearin' suits and ties.


01:27:56.273 --> 01:27:59.208
Well he don't wear
no suit and tie.


01:27:59.243 --> 01:28:02.346
And he don't fuck his
informants neither.


01:28:03.579 --> 01:28:07.616
Susan, to be honest, you
don't look five months pregnant.


01:28:07.618 --> 01:28:10.454
They say drugs keep it small.


01:28:13.789 --> 01:28:17.627
Have you thought about
getting an abortion?


01:28:35.612 --> 01:28:40.650
Can we please just try and
have a reasonable conversation?


01:28:47.289 --> 01:28:49.824
You were gonna save me.


01:28:49.826 --> 01:28:54.899
I needed someone to save me,
and you were gonna be the one.


01:28:54.931 --> 01:28:57.001
You even said so yourself.


01:29:03.506 --> 01:29:05.241
Susan, if I could
drop everything


01:29:05.275 --> 01:29:07.077
and start again, I would.


01:29:08.345 --> 01:29:12.483
I'm trying to do the
right thing, I just can't.


01:29:13.684 --> 01:29:16.619
Look, the most important
thing here's the baby.


01:29:16.653 --> 01:29:17.852
What do you want to do about it?


01:29:17.854 --> 01:29:21.022
Do you want me and
Kathy to raise it?


01:29:21.024 --> 01:29:22.525
You and Kathy?


01:29:23.860 --> 01:29:26.130
I am a good mother!


01:29:26.162 --> 01:29:27.163
Come on, Susan.


01:29:27.197 --> 01:29:28.331
Where are your kids now?


01:29:28.364 --> 01:29:30.867
You take that back,
you son of a bitch.


01:29:30.934 --> 01:29:31.969
How dare you!


01:29:33.871 --> 01:29:34.702
Take it back!


01:29:43.846 --> 01:29:45.014
Christ!


01:29:45.047 --> 01:29:46.615
What the hell's the
matter with you, Susan?


01:29:46.649 --> 01:29:47.885
You tryin' to kill us both?


01:29:47.951 --> 01:29:48.717
Me?


01:29:48.719 --> 01:29:50.688
You're the one
who's screwin' me.


01:29:50.720 --> 01:29:54.223
I'll be damned if I'll watch
you prance back to Chicago


01:29:54.225 --> 01:29:56.460
with that stuck-up
wife of yours.


01:29:56.493 --> 01:29:58.395
How about we leave my
wife out of this, okay?


01:29:58.462 --> 01:30:00.297
She's the only one who hasn't
brought this on herself.


01:30:00.329 --> 01:30:02.298
You fucked up my life.


01:30:02.332 --> 01:30:04.167
Oh, Jesus, just tell
me, Susan, please,


01:30:04.201 --> 01:30:06.537
what is it that you want?


01:30:06.569 --> 01:30:09.572
I want you to have
this baby with me.


01:30:09.640 --> 01:30:11.875
I want you to be
there when he's born.


01:30:11.908 --> 01:30:15.076
And I want you to sign the
birth certificate as his daddy.


01:30:15.078 --> 01:30:18.245
Second, I want you to
leave that whore, Kathy,


01:30:18.247 --> 01:30:19.914
and those stuck-up brat kids.


01:30:19.916 --> 01:30:22.584
I swear, if you say one
more thing about my wife...


01:30:22.586 --> 01:30:23.887
Oh, what are
you gonna do, huh?


01:30:23.920 --> 01:30:24.587
You gonna hit me?


01:30:24.654 --> 01:30:25.589
Well, go ahead, 'cause men


01:30:25.655 --> 01:30:29.092
have been hittin'
me my whole life.


01:30:29.158 --> 01:30:29.893
Jesus Christ.


01:30:29.926 --> 01:30:31.161
Please!


01:30:31.194 --> 01:30:33.329
Can we just try to find a
solution for our problem?


01:30:33.363 --> 01:30:35.231
Our problem?


01:30:35.265 --> 01:30:36.900
Your problem.


01:30:36.934 --> 01:30:38.869
I've never been
happier in my life.


01:30:38.902 --> 01:30:40.237
Is I.


01:30:40.270 --> 01:30:44.608
I told all my friends that
I'm a raise me an FBI baby.


01:30:45.708 --> 01:30:47.376
Oh my god, you're
fuckin' nuts.


01:30:47.411 --> 01:30:48.444
Do you really think I'd ever let


01:30:48.511 --> 01:30:50.212
a kid of mine grow up with you?


01:30:50.247 --> 01:30:51.081
Fuck you.


01:30:51.114 --> 01:30:51.946
Fuck you.


01:30:51.948 --> 01:30:52.949
Fuck you to hell!


01:30:55.851 --> 01:30:57.453
Well,
that wasn't exactly


01:30:57.520 --> 01:30:59.689
a meetin' of the minds.


01:31:05.628 --> 01:31:08.198
Least he felt bad
about the whole thing.


01:31:08.231 --> 01:31:09.699
He couldn't eat.


01:31:10.466 --> 01:31:12.135
He couldn't sleep.


01:31:19.542 --> 01:31:22.947
For months, he didn't
know what to do.


01:31:30.819 --> 01:31:33.623
Then, all of a sudden, he did.


01:31:41.832 --> 01:31:45.469
I need to
tell you something.


01:31:45.502 --> 01:31:46.670
Now?


01:31:47.503 --> 01:31:48.671
Yeah.


01:31:49.739 --> 01:31:52.076
Before I tell anyone else.


01:31:53.176 --> 01:31:54.911
It's about me and Susan.


01:31:54.944 --> 01:31:55.979
Don't.


01:31:56.011 --> 01:31:56.846
It's over.


01:31:56.912 --> 01:31:58.248
It's in the past.


01:32:00.917 --> 01:32:01.852
It's not.


01:32:12.529 --> 01:32:14.198
All right, shoot.


01:32:19.368 --> 01:32:21.204
I'm so sorry, Kathy.


01:32:26.210 --> 01:32:28.546
It's worse than you think.


01:32:30.646 --> 01:32:33.050
Did you get her pregnant?


01:32:36.853 --> 01:32:37.820
Yeah.


01:32:54.503 --> 01:32:55.672
Kathy.


01:32:56.472 --> 01:32:57.675
Don't.


01:32:59.809 --> 01:33:01.078
I didn't mean
don't have a drink.


01:33:01.644 --> 01:33:02.646
Good.


01:33:03.712 --> 01:33:05.882
I meant there's more.


01:33:15.692 --> 01:33:18.395
Fuck you, fuck you, fuck you!


01:33:19.930 --> 01:33:20.931
Fuck you!


01:33:32.876 --> 01:33:33.510
Stop!


01:33:33.542 --> 01:33:34.711
Stop it!


01:33:35.278 --> 01:33:36.445
You're not gonna win!


01:33:36.512 --> 01:33:38.615
You're never gonna win!


01:33:48.291 --> 01:33:49.293
Stop it!


01:34:38.341 --> 01:34:40.010
It was an accident.


01:34:40.911 --> 01:34:41.912
I swear.


01:34:42.613 --> 01:34:45.015
If it was an accident...


01:34:45.914 --> 01:34:48.452
why didn't you tell somebody?


01:34:51.854 --> 01:34:53.022
We were fighting.


01:34:54.323 --> 01:34:55.791
If it was an accident
while we were fighting,


01:34:55.824 --> 01:34:58.094
that's manslaughter.


01:34:58.127 --> 01:35:01.865
I'm going to Washington
today to confess.


01:35:03.033 --> 01:35:04.034
I have to.


01:35:05.435 --> 01:35:06.804
You have to?


01:35:09.538 --> 01:35:11.041
It's what my father
would've wanted.


01:35:11.108 --> 01:35:12.141
You father?


01:35:12.175 --> 01:35:13.342
You're worried
about your father?


01:35:14.711 --> 01:35:16.544
'Course I
remember those last few minutes


01:35:16.546 --> 01:35:18.648
a little different than he does.


01:35:45.875 --> 01:35:50.514
But people only remember
what they can stand to.


01:36:03.594 --> 01:36:05.662
Don't tell anyone.


01:36:05.695 --> 01:36:06.896
Not anyone.


01:36:09.432 --> 01:36:12.101
It can stay between you and me.


01:36:14.503 --> 01:36:16.273
I can live with this.


01:36:18.408 --> 01:36:19.409
I can.


01:36:25.782 --> 01:36:26.949
I can't.


01:36:31.520 --> 01:36:33.055
Baby, I've tried.


01:36:37.261 --> 01:36:38.362
I just can't.


01:36:40.863 --> 01:36:43.132
By then, Mark
wanted to be punished.


01:36:44.033 --> 01:36:46.135
He thought he deserved it.


01:36:47.470 --> 01:36:50.373
The average sentence for
manslaughter is six years.


01:36:50.407 --> 01:36:51.574
You serve two.


01:36:52.774 --> 01:36:54.076
I'm sorry.


01:36:54.109 --> 01:36:56.578
Mark
took 14 and served 10.


01:36:56.613 --> 01:36:59.149
You're just doing your job.


01:37:01.149 --> 01:37:03.151
Kathy stood by him.


01:37:03.153 --> 01:37:04.154
Or tried to.


01:37:05.555 --> 01:37:10.491
She died of drink about
a year 'fore he got out.


01:37:10.493 --> 01:37:11.493
Yes, I did.


01:37:11.560 --> 01:37:13.563
You did what, Agent Putnam?


01:37:13.595 --> 01:37:15.464
It's important that
you be specific.


01:37:15.498 --> 01:37:17.333
For a second it sounded
like you meant to say...


01:37:17.399 --> 01:37:19.168
I didn't mean that.


01:37:19.936 --> 01:37:21.171
I killed her.


01:37:22.005 --> 01:37:23.140
I broke her neck.


01:37:24.640 --> 01:37:27.777
He surprised the
hell outta people round here.


01:37:27.810 --> 01:37:32.581
They figured somebody I'd
snitched on had done it.


01:37:32.615 --> 01:37:34.149
He told 'em where
to find me, too,


01:37:34.184 --> 01:37:37.320
or they wouldn't a had
no proof of nothin'.


01:37:37.353 --> 01:37:39.155
I've got somethin'!


01:37:43.025 --> 01:37:44.357
Course, he
didn't decide to confess


01:37:44.359 --> 01:37:47.197
until 10 months
after he killed me,


01:37:47.262 --> 01:37:50.300
so the dogs got
at me pretty good.


01:37:55.137 --> 01:37:56.704
If I hadn't a been so mad,


01:37:56.706 --> 01:38:00.010
I woulda just had
the baby by myself.


01:38:03.546 --> 01:38:04.948
God damn you.


01:38:15.524 --> 01:38:16.559
That's her.


01:38:30.305 --> 01:38:31.473
I guess I was wrong


01:38:31.506 --> 01:38:33.975
about all them gettin'
what they wanted, huh?


01:38:34.010 --> 01:38:36.246
In the long run, anyways.


01:38:38.081 --> 01:38:41.184
Course, in the
long run, who does?


01:38:46.588 --> 01:38:51.028
Like I said, worst
thing about being dead,


01:38:51.927 --> 01:38:54.730
you get too much time to think.


01:39:23.693 --> 01:39:28.797
And I knew right at that
point that I had compromised


01:39:28.864 --> 01:39:32.435
everything that
I had worked for.


01:39:35.971 --> 01:39:38.307
Because I broke the first rule


01:39:39.275 --> 01:39:43.311
of an FBI agent-informant
relationship.


01:39:43.313 --> 01:39:45.748
Never sleep with
your informants.


01:39:45.780 --> 01:39:50.483
I pride myself on my ability
to compartmentalise aspects


01:39:50.485 --> 01:39:55.257
of my life, and I thought that
I could keep that in check.


01:39:56.158 --> 01:39:58.161
I cared a great deal for her.


01:39:58.793 --> 01:40:01.131
I can't lie about that.


01:40:01.163 --> 01:40:04.498
A lot of her
problems that she had


01:40:04.500 --> 01:40:07.170
were a result of her
cooperating with me.


01:40:07.237 --> 01:40:10.774
She came across the
seat and jumped on me


01:40:12.007 --> 01:40:14.342
and started punching,
and hitting,


01:40:14.409 --> 01:40:16.578
and slapping, and pulling hair.


01:40:16.612 --> 01:40:19.916
She kept comin' at
me, and I grabbed her.


01:40:19.948 --> 01:40:22.918
And I said, "Cut the crap."


01:40:22.953 --> 01:40:27.256
I didn't realise the
force that I had on her.


01:40:27.289 --> 01:40:31.360
And next thing I knew,
she was layin' into me.


01:40:33.296 --> 01:40:34.698
Nothing.


01:40:34.764 --> 01:40:37.199
Then I looked up in the air,


01:40:37.265 --> 01:40:40.136
and I said, "What do I do, dad?


01:40:41.136 --> 01:40:42.438
"What do I do?"


01:44:22.104 --> 01:44:27.104
